entries[122555] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Sleeper Sushi", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to make Sleeper Sushi.\nRequires Draenor Cooking (1)\nSell Price:\nSleeper Sushi\nUse: Restores 8173 health and ( 2125 / 5 * 20) mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 14 mastery for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Fat Sleeper Flesh (12), Crescent Saberfish Flesh (6)" }
